# Networking + DI
- Retrofit wiring is centralized in `app/data/remote/apis/APIModule.kt`.
- `baseUrl` must come from `BuildConfig.BASE_URL`.
- OkHttp uses:
  - `AppInterceptor` (adds JSON headers + Authorization Bearer token when available)
  - Chucker interceptor for debugging
  - HttpLoggingInterceptor (BODY)
- Every new API interface must be provided from `APIModule` (add `provideXApi()`).
- When adding auth-related behavior, prefer changes in `AppInterceptor` and/or local token flow.

